#. <CLT 4>外の情報に飢えてきた…
#. ここでテレビでも見られればな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I'm starving for information from the outside world.\n"
"If only there was a TV that worked...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>こんな監視カメラで見張られる生活が…
#. 一体、いつまで続くんだよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>How long am I going to be stuck here, being watched by\n"
"all these cameras...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今は、こんな鉄板なんか
#. 気にしている場合じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time to worry about this metal plate now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何か手掛かりを見つけないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0004 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I don't find some kind of clue...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>今は、こんな鉄板なんか
#. 気にしている場合じゃない…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0005 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I don't have time to worry about this metal plate now.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>何か手掛かりを見つけないと…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>If I don't find some kind of clue...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>初日に、ボクが突っ伏していた机…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>This is the desk I woke up on when I first got here.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>机の上には、あの安っぽいパンフレットが
#. 置きっぱなしになっている…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The little pamphlet is still laying there...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. 他に何か、
#. 事件解決の手がかりになるもの…
msgctxt "0009 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Isn't there anything that might help solve this case?"
msgstr ""

#. ……ここには、ないか。
msgctxt "0010 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...There's nothing here."
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>時計があって時間はわかるけど…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>There's a clock telling me what time it is...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>外が見えないんじゃ、
#. それが正しいのかもわからないな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>But I can't see outside, so I have no idea if it's\n"
"even right.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>そういえば、捜査に制限時間はあるんだろうか…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Speaking of which, I wonder if there's a time limit on\n"
"our investigation...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0014 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0015 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0016 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
